ught for by other game, as deer.","dna16":"8800127677001121","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:noun:11","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"12:1","syn":["dirt","earth"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"Dung; compost; manure.","dna16":"8800127677001220","ex":["night soil"],"id":"wikt:soil:noun:12","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":["dirt","earth"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"A food preparation with the texture and often color of soil.","dna16":"8800127677001329","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:noun:13","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"18:1","syn":["dirt","earth"],"tags":["countable","uncountable"]},{"def":"To become dirty or soiled.","dna16":"8800127677001428","ex":["Light colours soil sooner than dark ones."],"id":"wikt:soil:verb:14","pos":"verb","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[],"tags":["intransitive"]},{"def":"To stain or mar, as with infamy or disgrace; to tarnish; to sully.","dna16":"8800127677001527","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:verb:15","pos":"verb","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[],"tags":["figuratively","transitive"]},{"def":"To dirty one's clothing by accidentally defecating while clothed.","dna16":"8800127677001626","ex":["The child was so scared she soiled herself."],"id":"wikt:soil:verb:16","pos":"verb","src":"wikt","sym":"4:1","syn":[],"tags":["reflexive"]},{"def":"To make invalid, to ruin.","dna16":"8800127677001725","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:verb:17","pos":"verb","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[]},{"def":"To enrich with soil or muck; to manure.","dna16":"8800127677001824","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:verb:18","pos":"verb","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[]},{"def":"Faeces or urine etc. when found on clothes.","dna16":"8800127677001923","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:noun:19","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"4:1","syn":[],"tags":["euphemistic","uncountable"]},{"def":"A bag containing soiled items.","dna16":"8800127677002020","ex":[],"id":"wikt:soil:noun:20","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[],"tags":["countable"]},{"def":"A wet or marshy place in which a boar or 